# Black Stride ship registry manifest: one .ship card path per line ('#' comments).
# Loaded once at game init by ship_registry_load (sim/ship_def.cpp); every hull the game
# can spawn is one card here, and spawn sites reference cards by their `id` line.
assets/ships/ship/ship.ship
assets/enemy_ship.ship
assets/ships/npc/npc_escort.ship
assets/ships/npc/npc_hauler.ship
assets/ships/npc/npc_warship.ship
